  "details": "In the latest update, item descriptions in the inventory are now displayed at the very top of the action menu. I find this feature extremely useful.\n\nMy proposal is to make this available more widely – in particular within ExMenu. At present, on-screen text can overlap buttons, making it difficult to read. While this layout works fine for simple menu buttons, it is less suited to more detailed descriptions. Allowing users to add custom supplementary text would greatly enhance usability.\n\nI hope you will give this suggestion your consideration.",
